                <pb facs="0060" n="40" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v02/pg40"/>

                <head>22. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On January 15, 1962, Secretary of Defense McNamara, Ambassador Nolting, Admiral Felt,
                        General McGarr, and numerous other
                    officials met at CINCPAC Headquarters in
                    Honolulu for the second Secretary of Defenseʼs Conference. A full record of the
                    meeting is in Washington National Records Center, RG 84, Saigon Embassy Files:
                    FRC 68 A 5159, SGN (62) 19-GVN-DEFSEC-CINCPAC. For a summary record, see <ref
                        target="#d29">Document 29</ref>. Regarding the first Honolulu Conference,
                    December 16, 1961, see <ref target="frus:frus1961-63v01/d324"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1961–1963, volume I,
                        Document 324</ref>.</p>
            </div>
